---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import ContentLayout from '../components/ContentLayout.astro';
import FeatureCard from '../components/FeatureCard.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Drive with TRYP" description="Drive with TRYP and build a local opportunity on your terms." path="/drive/">
  <PageHero eyebrow="For drivers" title={'Your car.<br /><em>Your opportunity.</em>'} description="TRYP connects local drivers with passengers who need to get where they are going. Choose when you go online and make the journey work for you." />
  <ContentLayout items={[{ href: '#why', label: 'Why TRYP' }, { href: '#process', label: 'How onboarding works' }, { href: '#requirements', label: 'What to prepare' }, { href: '#start', label: 'Get started' }]}>
    <h2 id="why">Built for local drivers</h2>
    <p class="lead">Driving with TRYP means joining a service that is growing around the places you already know. The driver app keeps ride information and your working status close at hand.</p>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <FeatureCard icon="◷" title="Work on your terms" text="Choose when you are available and manage your online status from the driver app." tone="green" />
      <FeatureCard icon="⌖" title="Know the trip" text="See key ride details before accepting so you can make an informed decision." tone="blue" />
      <FeatureCard icon="♢" title="Grow locally" text="Help passengers move through your community while building your driver profile." tone="gold" />
    </div>
    <h2 id="process">A guided onboarding flow</h2>
    <p>The driver app guides you through account registration, profile details, vehicle information, and document submission. The TRYP team reviews the required information before a driver can take rides.</p>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <FeatureCard icon="01" title="Create your profile" text="Register in the driver app with your personal and contact information." tone="red" />
      <FeatureCard icon="02" title="Submit documents" text="Provide the required driver and vehicle documents for review." tone="blue" />
      <FeatureCard icon="03" title="Go online" text="Once approved, use the driver app to manage your availability and rides." tone="green" />
    </div>
    <h2 id="requirements">What to prepare</h2>
    <p>Keep your valid driver, vehicle, and identity documents available. Final requirements may vary as TRYP completes its launch and compliance process, so the app will provide the most current checklist.</p>
    <div class="notice"><strong>Driver onboarding is handled in the TRYP Driver app.</strong><br />This keeps identity and document information inside the protected onboarding flow rather than asking you to submit it on a public website.</div>
    <h2 id="start">Interested in driving?</h2>
    <p>Download the driver app when the public store listing is available, or contact the TRYP team to ask about the rollout in your area.</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="button button-red" href="mailto:hello@tryp.co.za">Contact the TRYP team ↗</a><a class="button button-outline" href="/driver-terms/">Read Driver Terms →</a><a class="button button-outline" href="/driver-code/">Read Driver Code →</a><a class="button button-outline" href="/driver-agreement/">Read Driver Agreement →</a><a class="button button-outline" href="/support/">Read support →</a></div>
  </ContentLayout>
</SiteLayout>
